    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_agenda",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "We are drifting beyond the agenda, so I want to capture that issue separately and bring us back to the decision we need today."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "داریم از دستور جلسه دور می‌شیم؛ اون موضوع رو جدا ثبت می‌کنم و برمی‌گردیم به تصمیمی که امروز لازم داریم."
        },
        "intent": "manage_agenda",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_agenda",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_facilitate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_voices",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "Before we test consensus, I want to hear from people who have not spoken yet; otherwise silence may be mistaken for agreement."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "قبل از سنجش اجماع می‌خوام از کسانی که هنوز حرف نزدن بشنویم؛ وگرنه سکوت ممکنه اشتباهی به‌عنوان موافقت برداشت بشه."
        },
        "intent": "balance_participation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_consensus",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dominance"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_synthesize",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Let me synthesize the discussion: we have convergence on the objective, but two unresolved disagreements about timing and ownership."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "بذار بحث رو ترکیبی جمع‌بندی کنم: روی هدف نزدیک شدیم، ولی دو اختلاف حل‌نشده درباره زمان‌بندی و مسئولیت داریم."
        },
        "intent": "synthesize_discussion",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_synthesize",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_convergence"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_intervention",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I am going to intervene here because the same two positions are repeating without answering each other's central concern."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اینجا دخالت می‌کنم چون دو موضع دارن تکرار می‌شن بدون اینکه به نگرانی اصلی همدیگه جواب بدن."
        },
        "intent": "intervene_productively",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_intervention",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dissent"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dissent",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I want the dissent recorded clearly; consensus does not require us to erase a material objection."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌خوام مخالفت واضح ثبت بشه؛ اجماع لازم نیست یک ایراد مهم رو پاک کنه."
        },
        "intent": "preserve_dissent",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dissent",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_consensus"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dominance",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The problem is not that one person speaks often; it is that conversational dominance is narrowing which options receive serious examination."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مشکل فقط زیاد حرف زدن یک نفر نیست؛ غلبه در گفتگو داره گزینه‌هایی رو که جدی بررسی می‌شن محدود می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "address_dominance",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dominance",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_facilitate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_test",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Can everyone live with this version, including those who would not choose it as their first option?"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "همه می‌تونن با این نسخه کنار بیان، حتی کسانی که انتخاب اولشون نیست؟"
        },
        "intent": "test_working_consensus",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_consensus",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_convergence"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_close",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "We have a decision, one explicit reservation and two owners; I will close by restating all three so nothing gets lost."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک تصمیم داریم، یک ملاحظه صریح و دو مسئول؛ در پایان هر سه رو دوباره می‌گم که چیزی گم نشه."
        },
        "intent": "close_facilitated_discussion",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_dissent",
          "c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_agenda"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
