    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_discourse_management",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-01",
        "slug": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-discourse-management",
        "title": "Managing complex discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Use signposting and metadiscourse to frame, sequence, return to, and close complex points without losing the listener.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با signposting و metadiscourse نکات پیچیده را قاب‌بندی، مرتب، دوباره جمع و نتیجه‌گیری می‌کنیم تا شنونده مسیر بحث را گم نکند."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Before I come back to that point, let me clarify one assumption.",
            "fa": "قبل از اینکه به آن نکته برگردم، بگذار یک فرض را روشن کنم."
          },
          {
            "en": "That brings us to the broader question of accountability.",
            "fa": "این ما را به پرسش گسترده‌تر پاسخ‌گویی می‌رساند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_reformulation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-02",
        "slug": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-reformulation",
        "title": "Reformulation and precision",
        "rule_summary": "Use in other words, more precisely, what I mean is, or rather to refine a statement when the first wording is incomplete or misleading.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با in other words، more precisely، what I mean is و or rather جمله را اصلاح یا دقیق‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The system is inefficient—or rather, inefficient under peak demand.",
            "fa": "سیستم ناکارآمد است؛ یا دقیق‌تر بگویم، در اوج تقاضا ناکارآمد است."
          },
          {
            "en": "What I mean is that the risk is concentrated, not universal.",
            "fa": "منظورم این است که ریسک متمرکز است، نه همگانی."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_diplomatic_language",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "slug": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-diplomatic-language",
        "title": "Diplomatic challenge and disagreement",
        "rule_summary": "Challenge an idea rather than a person, acknowledge intent, and soften direct negatives while keeping the substantive point clear.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "به‌جای شخص، ایده را به چالش می‌کشیم؛ نیت را می‌پذیریم و بدون مبهم کردن اصل پیام، منفی مستقیم را نرم‌تر می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I see the logic, though I'm not convinced the assumption holds in this case.",
            "fa": "منطقش را می‌بینم، هرچند قانع نشده‌ام این فرض در این مورد برقرار باشد."
          },
          {
            "en": "That may be true in principle, but the practical constraints are different.",
            "fa": "در اصل شاید درست باشد، اما محدودیت‌های عملی متفاوت‌اند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-01",
        "title": "Facilitating Complex Discussion & Consensus Testing: part 1",
        "setting": "strategy meeting",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "characters": [
          "Ella",
          "Amir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "What do you make of the way this is being framed?",
            "translation_fa": "از نحوه مطرح شدن این موضوع چه برداشتی داری؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "We are drifting beyond the agenda, so I want to capture that issue separately and bring us back to the decision we need today.",
            "translation_fa": "داریم از دستور جلسه دور می‌شیم؛ اون موضوع رو جدا ثبت می‌کنم و برمی‌گردیم به تصمیمی که امروز لازم داریم."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Is there another interpretation we should keep in view?",
            "translation_fa": "تفسیر دیگه‌ای هست که باید در نظر داشته باشیم؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "Before we test consensus, I want to hear from people who have not spoken yet; otherwise silence may be mistaken for agreement.",
            "translation_fa": "قبل از سنجش اجماع می‌خوام از کسانی که هنوز حرف نزدن بشنویم؛ وگرنه سکوت ممکنه اشتباهی به‌عنوان موافقت برداشت بشه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_scene_2",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-02",
        "title": "Facilitating Complex Discussion & Consensus Testing: part 2",
        "setting": "seminar break",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "jobs",
        "characters": [
          "Emma",
          "Kai"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Emma",
            "text": "Which assumption is doing most of the work here?",
            "translation_fa": "کدوم فرض بیشترین نقش رو در این استدلال داره؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Kai",
            "text": "Let me synthesize the discussion: we have convergence on the objective, but two unresolved disagreements about timing and ownership.",
            "translation_fa": "بذار بحث رو ترکیبی جمع‌بندی کنم: روی هدف نزدیک شدیم، ولی دو اختلاف حل‌نشده درباره زمان‌بندی و مسئولیت داریم."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Emma",
            "text": "How would the conclusion change if that assumption failed?",
            "translation_fa": "اگر اون فرض برقرار نباشه نتیجه چطور عوض می‌شه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Kai",
            "text": "I am going to intervene here because the same two positions are repeating without answering each other's central concern.",
            "translation_fa": "اینجا دخالت می‌کنم چون دو موضع دارن تکرار می‌شن بدون اینکه به نگرانی اصلی همدیگه جواب بدن."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_facilitating_complex_discussion_scene_3",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-facilitating-complex-discussion-03",
        "title": "Facilitating Complex Discussion & Consensus Testing: part 3",
